Package: overlayfs-tools
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: tools to manage OverlayFS filesystems
 Provides utilities to maintain OverlayFS, including an offline 
 merge tool necessary for syncing writable RAM layers back 
 to persistent storage.
